"><span begin="36.263" end="36.439">What</span> <span begin="36.439" end="36.612">this</span> <span begin="36.612" end="36.962">fee</span><span begin="36.962" end="37.144">ling</span> <span begin="37.144" end="37.492">is</span> <span begin="37.492" end="37.666">in</span><span begin="37.666" end="38.211">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份位于心中的情感</span></p><p begin="39.153" end="41.142" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.153" end="39.417">So</span> <span begin="39.417" end="39.960">far</span> <span begin="40.271" end="40.444">a</span><span begin="40.444" end="41.142">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥于天边</span></p><p begin="41.806" end="44.031" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.806" end="42.029">But</span> <span begin="42.029" end="42.199">I</span> <span begin="42.199" end="42.515">want</span> <span begin="42.515" end="42.714">you</span> <span begin="42.714" end="43.073">by</span> <span begin="43.073" end="43.191">my</span> <span begin="43.191" end="44.031">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我仍期望你能伴我身旁</span></p><p begin="44.649" end="47.070" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.649" end="44.829">When</span> <span begin="44.829" end="44.996">the</span> <span begin="44.996" end="45.516">days</span> <span begin="45.516" end="46.030">feel</span> <span begin="46.030" end="47.070">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当日常已觉漫长</span></p><p begin="47.430" end="49.772" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.430" end="47.604">And</span> <span begin="47.604" end="47.783">I</span> <span begin="47.783" end="48.303">close</span> <span begin="48.303" end="48.829">my</span> <span begin="48.829" end="49.772">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是闭上了双眼</span></p><p begin="50.205" end="54.875" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.205" end="50.379">I</span> <span begin="50.379" end="50.557">can</span> <span begin="50.557" end="51.264">dream</span> <span begin="51.264" end="51.437">you</span><span begin="51.437" end="51.607">&apos;re</span> <span begin="51.607" end="52.309">by</span> <span begin="52.309" end="52.994">my</span> <span begin="52.994" end="54.875">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能在梦中与你相会啦</span></p><p begin="1:18.482" end="1:20.440" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.482" end="1:18.829">Fly</span> <span begin="1:18.829" end="1:19.189">high</span> <span begin="1:19.189" end="1:19.352">o</span><span begin="1:19.352" end="1:19.531">ver</span> <span begin="1:19.531" end="1:19.751">the</span> <span begin="1:19.751" end="1:20.440">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随心飞往那比月亮更高之处</span></p><p begin="1:20.741" end="1:23.370" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.741" end="1:20.915">So</span> <span begin="1:20.915" end="1:21.065">we</span> <span begin="1:21.065" end="1:21.216">can</span> <span begin="1:21.216" end="1:21.645">see</span> <span begin="1:21.645" end="1:21.786">a</span> <span begin="1:21.786" end="1:22.134">brand</span> <span begin="1:22.134" end="1:22.329">new</span> <span begin="1:22.329" end="1:23.370">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是崭新的世界屹立于我们眼前啦</span></p><p begin="1:24.005" end="1:26.053" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.005" end="1:24.353">Step</span> <span begin="1:24.353" end="1:24.766">step</span> <span begin="1:24.766" end="1:24.934">wal</span><span begin="1:24.934" end="1:25.105">king</span> <span begin="1:25.105" end="1:25.282">with</span> <span begin="1:25.282" end="1:26.053">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步，两步，携手与你前行</span></p><p begin="1:26.332" end="1:28.978" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.332" end="1:26.487">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:26.487" end="1:26.665">be</span> <span begin="1:26.665" end="1:26.852">to</span><span begin="1:26.852" end="1:27.190