end="1:38.973">my</span> <span begin="1:38.973" end="1:41.497">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想象你于我身旁</span></p><p begin="1:40.703" end="1:50.487" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.703" end="1:40.994">Ha</span> <span begin="1:41.835" end="1:42.122">ha</span> <span begin="1:42.889" end="1:43.252">ha</span><span begin="1:43.252" end="1:43.486">a</span> <span begin="1:43.486" end="1:43.842">ha</span> <span begin="1:44.472" end="1:44.804">ha</span> <span begin="1:46.380" end="1:46.676">ha</span> <span begin="1:47.393" end="1:47.740">ha</span> <span begin="1:48.474" end="1:48.823">ha</span><span begin="1:48.823" end="1:49.105">a</span> <span begin="1:49.105" end="1:49.428">ha</span> <span begin="1:50.200" end="1:50.487">ha</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:45.020" end="1:48.126"><span begin="1:45.020" end="1:45.280">(Fee</span><span begin="1:45.280" end="1:45.513">ling</span> <span begin="1:45.513" end="1:45.855">by</span> <span begin="1:45.855" end="1:45.965">your</span> <span begin="1:45.965" end="1:48.126">side)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉像是你正于我身旁</span></span></p><p begin="1:51.245" end="1:53.511" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.245" end="1:51.925">I</span> <span begin="1:51.925" end="1:52.345">call</span> <span begin="1:52.834" end="1:53.006">your</span> <span begin="1:53.006" end="1:53.511">name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻地呼唤着</span></p><p begin="1:54.413" end="1:56.548" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.413" end="1:54.583">Can</span> <span begin="1:54.583" end="1:54.751">you</span> <span begin="1:54.751" end="1:55.083">hear</span> <span begin="1:55.083" end="1:55.270">my</span> <span begin="1:55.270" end="1:55.635">lit</span><span begin="1:55.635" end="1:55.785">tle</span> <span begin="1:55.785" end="1:56.548">voice?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听见呢？</span></p><p begin="1:57.364" end="1:59.12